External binary dependency
--------------------------

The Backend links the separately distributed cdin-kernel package. That package
contains the public Kernel C library and its private static logging dependency,
m-mdy-m/log.c. Those files retain the copyright notices, licenses and NOTICE
materials supplied by their respective upstream projects. The Backend does not
copy, modify or claim ownership of those dependency sources. The downloaded
Kernel package installs its third-party license materials under
share/licenses/; deployments that redistribute the linked libraries must keep
those notices with the distribution.

Project names including CDIN, cdin-kernel, Lua and m-mdy-m/log.c identify their
respective projects and do not imply ownership beyond the contributions in this
repository.
